riting a longer answer.","icon":"📖","notice":"Repeating the worked example cannot show transfer to new numbers. Correct the value or method, not just the appearance of the digits.","title":"Transfer to a new problem"}],"title":"Year 4, Week 12, Lesson 4: Unit review and check-in","unit_number":3,"unit_title":"Multiplication and division","week":12,"week_in_unit":4,"word_challenges":null,"worked_example":"WORK THROUGH THIS\nReview path: fact → ×10 → area model → divide with remainder → factor list → word problem check.\n\nWrite what makes this example accurate, naming the places, values or distances used.","worked_visuals":[{"alt":"Multiplicative unit review.","caption":"Tally by skill.","svg":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 660 150\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"12\" width=\"310\" height=\"126\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#fff4ea\" stroke=\"#b87445\"/><rect x=\"340\" y=\"12\" width=\"310\" height=\"126\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#e8f5ed\" stroke=\"#297a61\"/><g font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#263948\"><text x=\"28\" y=\"42\">Review path</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"78\">fact → model → divide</text><text x=\"358\" y=\"42\">Then</text><text x=\"358\" y=\"78\">factors → word check</text></g></svg>"},{"alt":"Practice goal from tally.","caption":"Twenty-four review items.","svg":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 660 150\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"12\" width=\"310\" height=\"126\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#fff4ea\" stroke=\"#b87445\"/><rect x=\"340\" y=\"12\" width=\"310\" height=\"126\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#e8f5ed\" stroke=\"#297a61\"/><g font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#263948\"><text x=\"28\" y=\"42\">Goal</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"78\">weak family practice</text><text x=\"358\" y=\"42\">Risk</text><text x=\"358\" y=\"78\">skip inverse checks</text></g></svg>"}],"year_level":"Year 4"}') WHERE seed_key='s2-mat-y4-w12-l4' AND family_id IS NULL;
